{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Q7S3yRSgr31795595180.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>瑞銀指，AI投資仍屬結構性大趨勢，預期全球投資規模將由今年1萬億美元，增加至明年1.4萬億美元，2028年將進一步增加至1.5萬億美元。</p><p></p><p>瑞銀財富管理大中華區股票主管李智穎說︰「就算美國的數據中心2027年要開工那些，或預完工那些全部已定下不需要新批准，這些是可期盼，2027年盈利基本上也有底。因數據中心也好、訂單已來了也好，這些都會落實。變相如果市場有波動，這些半導體股份仍是我們重點想配置的板塊。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.338719+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T08:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:20:25.268185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:37:19.459113+00:00","content_hash":"7412a2f29f296348ffa811f63cc4b289c5d1c16c7896ae0ee36f7bddcebacab4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.338719+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}